      "stale_hits": [],
      "global_stale_hits": [],
      "answer": "TL;DR: The Shepherds (Shepherd\u2019s Flock) are a cult actively recruiting and agitating in the city, and they answer to the power/entity Maelthor.\n\nThe \u201cShepherds\u201d refers to the **Shepherd\u2019s Flock**, a cult group currently staging protests and recruiting members.  \n- **OBSERVED:** They are explicitly identified as *followers of Maelthor*.  \n- **CANON + OBSERVED:** Their actions\u2014recruiting \u201ctransformed\u201d individuals, justifying sacrifices, and pushing a doctrine of cleansing impurities\u2014are all framed as serving **Maelthor\u2019s influence and emergence**.\n\nThey present themselves publicly as defenders of humanity, but internally they operate as a zealous cult that believes their actions (including harmful ones) are necessary for a greater good tied to Maelthor.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Role: Protest leaders and cult recruiters\n- Faction: Followers of Maelthor (OBSERVED)\n- Goals: Recruit, \u201ccleanse\u201d the world, advance Maelthor\u2019s influence\n- Alignment context: Justify sacrifices as necessary for Maelthor\n- Public portrayal: Defenders against non-human threats\n- Activity: Actively recruiting and organizing unrest at the gates",
      "embedding_similarity": null
    },
