      "answer": "TL;DR: Merril handles agriculture/food, Torrin represents the guilds as master smith, and Rurik oversees infrastructure as chief architect.\n\nMerril Tealeaf  \n- Role (CANON/OBSERVED): Representative of Agriculture and Food Production; Leader of the Agricultural Union  \n- Focus: Food supply, agriculture, and public well-being  \n\nTorrin Flamescale  \n- Role (OBSERVED): Master Smith; Representative of the Guilds (Craft Guilds)  \n- Focus: Crafting industries, guild interests, and practical city concerns  \n\nRurik Stonehammer  \n- Role (CANON/OBSERVED): Representative of Infrastructure; Chief Architect  \n- Focus: City structure, defenses, and integrity (including tunnels/sewers)  \n\nKey Attributes  \n- Governance: Each represents a major city sector (agriculture, guilds, infrastructure) within the City Council  \n- Responsibilities: Merril (food systems), Torrin (industry/guilds), Rurik (construction and structural safety)",
      "embedding_similarity": null
    },
